message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "silence wouldn't protect anyone",
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Three years each feels closer to even than five against zero",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "If their lawyer had pushed for a joint arrangement before they signed anything"
  },
  {
    "sys_rule_justification": "I don't put another person inside a cell with my own words",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "a single shared solicitor from day one could have kept our accounts together"
  },
  {
    "sys_fairness_reciprocity": "Splitting it evenly at three and three seems fairer",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "If the investigators had interviewed us with counsel present instead of separately"
  },
  {
    "sys_contextual_flexibility": "The dilemma doesn't tell me whether either of us actually did anything",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "recorded interviews with a lawyer in the room would have kept this from turning"
  },
  {
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "my silence buys now is their freedom at the price of two more years",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "If they had simply asked their lawyer to hold the deal until my answer came"
  },
  {
    "ae_welfare_concern": "I'd rather they walk free than have my statement add three years",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "if the warehouse owner had installed decent cameras, the footage could have settled everything"
  },
  {
    "sys_instrumental_norm_use": "Silence made sense as a way to protect each other",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "If we'd sat down with someone before any of this and agreed"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Two years is real time with family, work, health.",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "the prosecutor could have offered us the same terms together, in one room"
  },
  {
    "sys_rule_justification": "testifying here would feel mostly like getting even, and I don't want that",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "If their attorney had explained that holding out might earn both of us a lighter"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "I'd rather serve three years than five",
    "pda_practical_counterfactual": "if the police had let us each speak to a lawyer before questioning started"
  }
]
